title: $:/changenotes/5.5.0/#10002
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

* Navigating from a modal now follows the tiddler opening behaviour set in the control panel (`$:/config/Navigation/openLinkFromOutsideRiver`), instead of always opening at the top of the story river
* Renaming a tiddler from a modal now follows the "Update tags and lists" setting (`$:/config/RelinkOnRename`)
